      "text": "🚧 The Katete–Mbarara City road has been closed for 3 weeks. All traffic is now diverted via the Nyamitanga–Isingiro route. Transport fares have jumped from UGX 1,000 to UGX 4,000–7,000. No word yet on when the road will reopen. #TheAnkoleTimes #MbararaCity #TrafficUpdate https://t.co/sYm8UqbhLC",
